<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent crude liftings jump, bulk to U.S..</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent crude liftings jump, bulk to U.S..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent Blend crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 864,908 tonnes in the week to December 30, up sharply from the previous week's 600,436 tonnes, the Shetlands Islands Council Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>The bulk of the crude, almost 500,000 tonnes, was destined for refineries in the United States.</p>
